OL,3,GNEWSAResidents still waiting to return
OL,4,Ahome after fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA month after a fire tore through a
OL,7,Fflat on the 17th floor of an east
OL,8,FLondon tower block, killing one man and
OL,9,Fforcing hundreds of people from their
OL,10,Fhomes, many residents are still waiting
OL,11,Fto find out when they will be allowed
OL,12,Fback.
OL,14,FThe blaze broke out on 13 September at
OL,15,Fthe 22-storey Neutron Tower on
OL,16,FBlackwall Way in Poplar. London Fire
OL,17,FBrigade said the fire was believed to
OL,18,Fhave been accidental.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
