OL,3,GNEWSAResidents still waiting to return
OL,4,Ahome after fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents remain in temporary
OL,7,Faccommodation while safety checks and
OL,8,Frepair work continue, with no date set
OL,9,Ffor their return.
OL,11,FFirstPort said assessments had been
OL,12,Fcompleted and contractors were due to
OL,13,Fstart work, while Notting Hill Genesis
OL,14,Fsaid it was supporting residents and
OL,15,Fworking to get them home.
